# Read by ripgrep (and so by Claude Code's Grep tool), not by git, docker or any
# build step. It hides generated build output from symbol searches so a hit is
# always in the source of truth. Gitignore syntax, anchored at the repo root.
#
# `git grep` does not read this file, and Claude Code's Glob bypasses it by default
# (unless CLAUDE_CODE_GLOB_NO_IGNORE=false): filter packaging/*/multi-llm/ out of
# their results yourself, or pass `--no-ignore` to rg to search the trees too.

# Generated plugin trees: committed byte copies of skills/multi-llm/ (plus the
# manifests and, for Codex, the MCP server and dist/). Regenerated by
# `make claude-regen codex-regen`; never edit them by hand.
/packaging/claude/multi-llm/
/packaging/codex/multi-llm/
